        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK primary key · FK foreign key · UQ unique · ? optional&lt;br&gt;Purple row = primary key · Orange row = foreign key · Yellow row = unique · Green row = Prisma relation field (not a stored column) · Gray row = @@index&lt;br&gt;Crow&#39;s foot: each FocusableStrip belongs to exactly one PdfDocument. Each PdfDocument has zero or many strips. Deleting a document deletes its strips." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1e293b;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
